 "remarks": "HEAT AND HOT WATER INCLUDED!!!  Perfectly located in East Norwalk. This spacious two-bedroom home is close to Calf Pasture Beach, SoNo's restaurants and nightlife, and just a short walk to the train station. The main level offers a bright eat in kitchen, a large primary bedroom with plenty of storage, a second bedroom, and an updated bathroom with porcelain tile floors and a subway tile shower. Upstairs, you'll find a spacious living room that could also be perfect for a home office or guest space. Heat and hot water are included in the monthly rent, making this an even better find. No pets allowed. Good credit required.",
